# Fail fast on stalled Maven Central transfers instead of hanging until the
# CI job timeout. Socket reads idle for 2 minutes are aborted and retried by
# the resolver's retry handler; steady transfers of any size are unaffected.
# Maven Resolver 1.9.x (Maven 3.9.x) property names.
#
# These do NOT bound the silent ubuntu-lane stalls that originally motivated
# them. Those turned out to be dokka resolving its runtime tree at mojo
# execution time, and kept hanging for ~15 minutes with these timeouts already
# in force; -Pgen-dokka has since been dropped from the CI matrix.
-Daether.connector.connectTimeout=30000
-Daether.connector.requestTimeout=120000
